  "correctValue": "512",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>8</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;vertices of a regular octagon lying on a circle of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>.</p><p>Now using the concept of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;root of unity,</p><p>Let any point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;be,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>Z</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>Z</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>here&#160;</mtext><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>Z</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>)</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>Z</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>&#160;But&#160;</mtext><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>Z</mi><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>Z</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right left right left right left right left right left right left\" columnspacing=\"0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em\" rowspacing=\"3pt\"><mtr><mtd><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>|</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfe